[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芳乃……我要给你脱掉了」","art":{"background":"a2254","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……唔、好、好的……」","art":{"background":"a2254","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"裤袜被汗水浸湿、紧贴着肌肤。","art":{"background":"a2254","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"我缓缓将其褪下。","art":{"background":"a2254","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"随着露出的肌肤越来越多，芳乃刚才一直积攒的热量也在我面前蒸腾。","art":{"background":"a2254","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「唔唔……啊、啊……啊、啊……」","art":{"background":"a2257","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"芳乃呼吸零乱，被我脱着裤袜。","art":{"background":"a2257","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"面前的雪白屁股散发出的热量就宛如荷尔蒙一般。","art":{"background":"a2257","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"些许的香味挑拨着我的鼻腔……让我的兴奋感更上一层了。","art":{"background":"a2257","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……芳乃，要全部脱掉了」","art":{"background":"a2257","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊、唔……呼……呼……唔唔」","art":{"background":"a2254","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"满面通红的芳乃终于整个屁股都一览无余。","art":{"background":"a2260","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且看来沾在上面的并不只是汗水。","art":{"background":"a2260","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"布的下面比想象得还要湿。","art":{"background":"a2260","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"}]